{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"带点意象"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"带点意象"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>带点意象就是意象带有点到它的一个"},{"Local":{"url":"几何态射","text":"几何态射"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>带点意象 $(\\mathcal X,x\\colon \\mathrm{pt}\\to\\mathcal X)$, 有两个几何态射</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$p=(\\mathrm{const}\\dashv\\Gamma)\\colon \\mathcal X\\to\\mathrm{pt}$,</li>\n<li>$x=(x^*\\dashv x_*) \\colon \\mathrm{pt}\\to\\mathcal X$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>其中</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathrm{const}$ 称为"},{"Local":{"url":"常值层","text":"常值层"}},{"Plain":"函子,</li>\n<li>$\\Gamma$ 称为"},{"Local":{"url":"整体截面","text":"整体截面"}},{"Plain":"函子,</li>\n<li>$x_*$ 称为"},{"Local":{"url":"摩天大楼层","text":"摩天大楼层"}},{"Plain":" (skyscraper sheaf),</li>\n<li>$x^* = (-)_x$ 称为"},{"Local":{"url":"茎","text":"茎"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p>由于 $px = \\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{pt}}$, 有\n$$\r\n\\Gamma\\circ x_* = \\mathrm{id},\r\n$$\n$$\r\nx^*\\circ\\mathrm{const} = \\mathrm{id}.\r\n$$\n从而有自然变换\n$$\r\n\\Gamma \\simeq x^*\\,\\mathrm{const}\\,\\Gamma \\to x^*.\r\n$$\n当这个自然变换为同构时称 $(\\mathcal X,x)$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"局部意象","text":"局部意象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}